    "detailed_description": "Use thermals to stay in the air.<br><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2604310/extras/5bdbcc53c838231d29169dfb18a41bae.poster.avif?t=1699906815\" width=600 height=338 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2604310/extras/5bdbcc53c838231d29169dfb18a41bae.webm?t=1699906815\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2604310/extras/5bdbcc53c838231d29169dfb18a41bae.mp4?t=1699906815\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span><br><br>Steer clear of rainy clouds.<br><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2604310/extras/2a145fec48b31aca35b4455628749516.poster.avif?t=1699906815\" width=600 height=338 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2604310/extras/2a145fec48b31aca35b4455628749516.webm?t=1699906815\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2604310/extras/2a145fec48b31aca35b4455628749516.mp4?t=1699906815\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span><br><br>Take a selfie at famous sites.<br><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2604310/extras/88e8aa8787ec19fcb7d08b55e7c3eaf7.poster.avif?t=1699906815\" width=600 height=338 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2604310/extras/88e8aa8787ec19fcb7d08b55e7c3eaf7.webm?t=1699906815\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2604310/extras/88e8aa8787ec19fcb7d08b55e7c3eaf7.mp4?t=1699906815\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span><br><br>Land before your bus leaves.<br><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2604310/extras/a2c68e6af74ca1237afb39f07563d041.poster.avif?t=1699906815\" width=600 height=338 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2604310/extras/a2c68e6af74ca1237afb39f07563d041.webm?t=1699906815\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2604310/extras/a2c68e6af74ca1237afb39f07563d041.mp4?t=1699906815\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span><br><br>Compete with other players for time, speed, and accuracy via leaderboards.<br><br><br><strong>Note from the developer</strong><br>I'm a cross-country paraglider from Bavaria. In this game, I wanted to captue the fun of flying cross-country, accessible for a wider gaming audience.<br><br>While it does have many realistic aspects of steering a glider, thermalling, and how thermal clouds cycle on and off, I erred on the arcade rather than the hyper-realistic simulation.<br><br>Real clouds don't pop with a satisfying &quot;bing&quot; sound when you touch them. I've touched many.<br><br>The game also tends to have more action than a real flight, which most of the time, feels pretty zen.<br><br>If you never had the chance to fly a paraglider, it's a bit like hiking, but from the comfort of a hammock. And with the most spectacular view.<br><br>I hope this game gets some of you interested in flying. And fills some idle ground time for my fellow pilots.<br><br>Enjoy and save landings!",
    "about_the_game": "Use thermals to stay in the air.<br><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2604310/extras/5bdbcc53c838231d29169dfb18a41bae.poster.avif?t=1699906815\" width=600 height=338 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2604310/extras/5bdbcc53c838231d29169dfb18a41bae.webm?t=1699906815\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2604310/extras/5bdbcc53c838231d29169dfb18a41bae.mp4?t=1699906815\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span><br><br>Steer clear of rainy clouds.<br><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2604310/extras/2a145fec48b31aca35b4455628749516.poster.avif?t=1699906815\" width=600 height=338 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2604310/extras/2a145fec48b31aca35b4455628749516.webm?t=1699906815\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2604310/extras/2a145fec48b31aca35b4455628749516.mp4?t=1699906815\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span><br><br>Take a selfie at famous sites.<br><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2604310/extras/88e8aa8787ec19fcb7d08b55e7c3eaf7.poster.avif?t=1699906815\" width=600 height=338 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2604310/extras/88e8aa8787ec19fcb7d08b55e7c3eaf7.webm?t=1699906815\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2604310/extras/88e8aa8787ec19fcb7d08b55e7c3eaf7.mp4?t=1699906815\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span><br><br>Land before your bus leaves.<br><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2604310/extras/a2c68e6af74ca1237afb39f07563d041.poster.avif?t=1699906815\" width=600 height=338 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2604310/extras/a2c68e6af74ca1237afb39f07563d041.webm?t=1699906815\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2604310/extras/a2c68e6af74ca1237afb39f07563d041.mp4?t=1699906815\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span><br><br>Compete with other players for time, speed, and accuracy via leaderboards.<br><br><br><strong>Note from the developer</strong><br>I'm a cross-country paraglider from Bavaria. In this game, I wanted to captue the fun of flying cross-country, accessible for a wider gaming audience.<br><br>While it does have many realistic aspects of steering a glider, thermalling, and how thermal clouds cycle on and off, I erred on the arcade rather than the hyper-realistic simulation.<br><br>Real clouds don't pop with a satisfying &quot;bing&quot; sound when you touch them. I've touched many.<br><br>The game also tends to have more action than a real flight, which most of the time, feels pretty zen.<br><br>If you never had the chance to fly a paraglider, it's a bit like hiking, but from the comfort of a hammock. And with the most spectacular view.<br><br>I hope this game gets some of you interested in flying. And fills some idle ground time for my fellow pilots.<br><br>Enjoy and save landings!",
    "short_description": "Panda &amp; Crow is a fun Third-Person Arcade Game where you play a paragliding panda. Use thermals to stay in the air, steer clear of rainy clouds, and hurry from site to site and take a selfie before your tour bus leaves!",
